# =============================================================================
# Build context for the Docusaurus image.
#
# BuildKit prefers `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` over the root `.dockerignore`
# and uses it INSTEAD of it — so the big exclusions are repeated here. The
# reason for a separate file: the root one excludes `documentation/` outright
# (labelled "old documentation site"), which is exactly the source this image
# builds. Editing the shared file would drag 2.4 MB of docs into the context of
# five other images that have no use for them.
# =============================================================================

# Everything the docs build never reads. `apps/` and `packages/` are excluded
# wholesale: documentation/ declares no workspace dependency and reaches
# outside its own directory nowhere — only the workspace manifests below are
# needed so `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` can resolve.
apps/
packages/
services/
aws/
documentation-archive/
scripts/

node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/build/
**/.docusaurus/
**/dist/
**/.turbo/
**/.cache/
**/coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key

.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/tmp/
